+With reranking on, each result also has \`relevance\`: the reranker's own 0-1 judgement of whether the matched passage answers the query, independent of the other results. \`score\` is a rank-weighted blend (the top hit scores high even when nothing relevant exists); judge hits by \`relevance\`.
